WEBVTT

00:00.910 --> 00:04.440
Dear Mother, thanks to the pianist John, I learned something.

00:05.450 --> 00:10.270
I have learned that the lullaby I have sung since I was a child was actually created by my father.

00:11.330 --> 00:14.020
Father carved his love into that song.

00:15.010 --> 00:17.180
And there is one more joyful thing...

00:26.630 --> 00:27.790
NAAJA

00:26.630 --> 00:27.790
Nadja

00:27.820 --> 00:30.290
kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:27.840 --> 00:30.290
With your eyes

00:30.290 --> 00:31.450
NAAJA

00:30.340 --> 00:31.450
Nadja

00:31.470 --> 00:33.720
nani ga mieru

00:31.470 --> 00:33.720
What do you see?

00:33.940 --> 00:36.830
haruka tooku hikaru

00:33.940 --> 00:36.830
Shining in the far distance,

00:36.980 --> 00:39.120
mirai no tobira

00:36.980 --> 00:39.120
The door to the future,

00:40.260 --> 00:43.670
sagashiteiru

00:40.260 --> 00:43.670
That's what I'm searching for

00:43.670 --> 00:50.880
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.590 --> 00:55.000
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:55.100 --> 00:58.360
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

00:55.100 --> 00:58.360
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:58.430 --> 01:01.810
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

00:58.460 --> 01:01.810
It could be so much more fun

01:01.840 --> 01:05.290
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:01.840 --> 01:05.290
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:05.660 --> 01:09.020
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:05.660 --> 01:09.020
I can't see the end of the journey

01:09.050 --> 01:12.210
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:09.050 --> 01:12.210
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:12.380 --> 01:16.030
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:12.380 --> 01:16.030
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:16.030 --> 01:18.180
te wo furinagara

01:16.030 --> 01:18.180
I will go waving

01:18.330 --> 01:25.070
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:18.330 --> 01:25.070
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:25.070 --> 01:27.810
ushiro mukanai

01:25.070 --> 01:27.810
But I won't look back

01:28.080 --> 01:33.120
yume ga kanau hima de

01:28.080 --> 01:33.120
Until the day my dream comes true

01:33.290 --> 01:36.670
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

01:33.290 --> 01:36.670
Nadja, your smile

01:36.750 --> 01:39.950
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:36.750 --> 01:39.950
Nadja, you give me courage

01:40.250 --> 01:43.210
aoi sora no shita de

01:40.250 --> 01:43.210
Under the blue sky

01:43.190 --> 01:46.000
ashita no yukue

01:43.190 --> 01:46.000
I will find the place

01:46.520 --> 01:50.150
mitsu kerukara

01:46.520 --> 01:50.150
Where my future lies

01:56.220 --> 01:57.090
Francis...

02:01.880 --> 02:03.060
What are you doing here?

02:04.030 --> 02:05.800
You are already acquaintances?

02:06.420 --> 02:08.990
I told you before. Didn't I, Nadja?

02:09.730 --> 02:14.810
While I was at the public school, there was someone who poured me tea...

02:18.760 --> 02:21.040
A lot has happened since I last saw you.

02:21.870 --> 02:24.660
I had to separate from everyone in the troupe.

02:27.780 --> 02:30.150
I was always alone.

02:32.190 --> 02:32.840
Alone.

02:36.860 --> 02:37.480
Nadja.

02:44.560 --> 02:48.960
Who Do I Like? Ultimate Decision!

02:57.910 --> 02:59.340
You lost your brooch in Egypt?

02:59.960 --> 03:03.960
Yes, the two detectives took my brooch.

03:05.100 --> 03:11.810
I somehow managed to get it back, but then I became a thief without realizing it.

03:19.170 --> 03:21.020
Ah, it's so nostalgic.

03:21.960 --> 03:26.700
The last time I was here, I had just joined the Dandelion Troupe.

03:28.870 --> 03:31.240
I wonder if everyone is doing well.

03:34.100 --> 03:38.520
Ever since we departed at the orphanage, you've been through a lot, haven't you?

03:39.290 --> 03:41.780
Yes...but there were also good things.

03:42.230 --> 03:44.150
I learned that my mother is still alive.

03:44.770 --> 03:47.460
I also learned what kind of person my father was.

03:49.140 --> 03:51.610
And...I also met you.

03:52.990 --> 03:57.060
Anyway, let's contact the Preminger Dukedom. I will also go.

03:57.730 --> 03:59.430
You don't have to worry.

04:10.720 --> 04:11.430
Francis.

04:27.650 --> 04:30.100
We shouldn't waste time, let's set out for Vienna at once.

04:30.640 --> 04:34.610
I will testify that you have had this brooch since long ago.

04:35.160 --> 04:36.610
Thank you, Francis.

04:38.320 --> 04:40.590
Somehow, everyone seems busy.

04:41.210 --> 04:44.710
Today we are holding a party, so everyone needs to be productive.

04:45.550 --> 04:47.970
I will be right back. Please wait here.

04:59.330 --> 05:00.040
Keith...

05:01.350 --> 05:02.090
Brother...

05:15.270 --> 05:15.790
Nadja.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.740
I've come to take you with me.

05:18.040 --> 05:18.750
Huh?

05:19.350 --> 05:21.270
Let's go to Vienna at once.

05:21.960 --> 05:22.800
To Vienna?

05:23.670 --> 05:26.140
I know where your mother is.

05:27.070 --> 05:30.140
She remarried and is at the Waltmüller Earldom.

05:30.380 --> 05:31.170
Now, let's go.

05:32.600 --> 05:33.470
Let go of her.

05:38.260 --> 05:41.270
Keith, I will take Nadja to Vienna.

05:42.210 --> 05:46.400
I intend to meet with Duke Preminger directly and properly explain the circumstances.

05:46.850 --> 05:49.370
If I testify about the brooch, surely...

05:49.420 --> 05:51.220
What a roundabout way to deal with it!

05:52.580 --> 05:54.600
Nadja only wants to meet her mother.

05:55.000 --> 05:56.480
The Duke has nothing to do with it.

05:56.870 --> 06:00.010
I will take Nadja and sneak ourselves into the Waldmüller House.

06:00.530 --> 06:02.770
Nadja can meet her mother at once.

06:03.830 --> 06:06.010
This method solves nothing!

06:06.870 --> 06:11.340
If we don't have the Duke acknowledge Nadja as his granddaughter, she can't live with her mother.

06:11.730 --> 06:16.010
To be acknowledged by the Duke means to become the successor of the Dukedom.

06:16.300 --> 06:17.390
Successor?

06:17.810 --> 06:21.710
That's right. Do you want to become an aristocrat and live a boring life?

06:22.200 --> 06:22.940
I...

06:23.090 --> 06:24.230
Don't decide for her.

06:25.310 --> 06:29.360
The life of a noble may not suit you, but...

06:29.780 --> 06:31.110
It also doesn't suit Nadja.

06:34.640 --> 06:35.760
I do understand it.

06:36.420 --> 06:39.880
Nadja, you are supposed to be a bird flying freely in the sky.

06:40.910 --> 06:44.050
You mustn't become a noble and enter a cage.

06:47.360 --> 06:48.840
Do not worry.

06:49.160 --> 06:49.900
Nadja...

06:51.580 --> 06:56.300
My mother, as a single person, lived upholding her own beliefs.

06:56.760 --> 06:59.180
Is it about life as a social creature again?

06:59.900 --> 07:02.790
You're quite satisfied with it, aren't you? Don't make me laugh!

07:03.160 --> 07:03.850
Keith!

07:04.790 --> 07:08.490
It's better than what you're doing, at least.

07:11.330 --> 07:15.770
To wear a mask and play the helper of justice.

07:19.820 --> 07:20.660
Francis...

07:21.700 --> 07:22.910
So you noticed.

07:23.870 --> 07:24.510
Nadja.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.940
You knew, right?

07:33.430 --> 07:35.280
That Keith is the Black Rose.

07:48.410 --> 07:49.720
The thief, Black Rose.

07:50.340 --> 07:51.990
You may want to help people, but...

07:52.900 --> 07:57.770
Brother, what you have done is simply thoughtless.

07:57.940 --> 07:58.580
Francis!

08:05.050 --> 08:05.940
Keith!

08:10.410 --> 08:11.740
So in the end it's about...

08:12.010 --> 08:12.950
Violence?

08:17.860 --> 08:19.120
Stop it, you two!

08:19.320 --> 08:20.580
Be silent, Nadja.

08:22.330 --> 08:25.690
There's no need to unite Nadja with Duke Preminger.

08:25.890 --> 08:28.800
It's enough to reunite her with her mother.

08:28.950 --> 08:32.630
No! Even if she meets her once, it won't settle anything.

08:33.470 --> 08:36.950
Even if it takes time, she should walk forward as planned.

08:37.190 --> 08:37.930
Keith!

08:38.110 --> 08:38.870
Francis!

08:39.070 --> 08:44.400
And what's more, if she is with you, Nadja will gradually fall into an unfavorable position.

08:44.820 --> 08:47.440
You are the Black Rose, after all!

08:47.640 --> 08:49.910
Don't make a blunder that will embarrass Nadja.

08:50.670 --> 08:51.590
Francis!

08:52.060 --> 08:52.570
Nadja!

08:55.360 --> 08:57.930
Now, come with me. Let's go to Vienna.

08:58.250 --> 09:00.420
Nadja, come with me.

09:01.710 --> 09:03.310
You must decide, Nadja.

09:03.780 --> 09:06.820
Whether you will go to Vienna with me or with Keith.

09:08.620 --> 09:12.770
In other words, it's about deciding whether you like me or him.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.630
Nadja, please choose.

09:17.850 --> 09:20.100
Um...I...

09:32.470 --> 09:33.140
Nadja!

09:34.890 --> 09:35.580
Brother!

09:37.040 --> 09:37.700
Nadja...

09:40.250 --> 09:41.970
You don't have to answer right now.

09:42.790 --> 09:45.160
But I would like you to decide before the day is over.

09:45.870 --> 09:46.640
That's right.

09:48.370 --> 09:49.630
Me or Francis?

09:50.570 --> 09:51.950
Who will you choose?

10:04.320 --> 10:05.080
You are...

10:06.020 --> 10:07.430
Mary Ann Hamilton.

10:08.560 --> 10:10.490
Earl Hamilton's daughter.

10:12.040 --> 10:13.720
Would you come with me for a moment?

10:19.400 --> 10:21.420
Quite a rainstorm, isn't it?

10:25.550 --> 10:30.090
Back then, you lent Francis your umbrella, didn't you?

10:35.320 --> 10:37.050
What is your name?

10:38.090 --> 10:39.620
Nadja Applefield.

10:40.310 --> 10:41.050
Nadja...

10:43.050 --> 10:45.490
You are actually a dancing girl, aren't you?

10:45.990 --> 10:46.980
Of a traveling troupe.

10:47.790 --> 10:48.210
Yes.

10:49.150 --> 10:53.960
I hate insinuations, so I won't beat around the bush.

10:55.490 --> 10:56.110
You...

10:57.620 --> 10:59.420
Keep your hands off of Francis.

11:25.420 --> 11:27.640
Keep your hands off of Francis.

11:36.570 --> 11:37.750
What do you mean?

11:39.060 --> 11:42.290
You can't make Francis happy.

11:42.740 --> 11:44.100
How do you know such a thing--

11:44.150 --> 11:45.550
Because if it's me, I can do it.

11:51.530 --> 11:55.430
I have always been looking at Francis.

11:56.590 --> 12:00.070
Ever since I was a child, I...

12:01.620 --> 12:04.040
I know everything about Francis.

12:05.030 --> 12:05.750
Everything?

12:06.290 --> 12:06.760
Yes.

12:08.490 --> 12:12.930
I know about the scar on his left hand that he received as a child when he fell from a tree.

12:14.040 --> 12:17.150
About how he cried when his cute dog died.

12:19.790 --> 12:24.730
How he was determined not to stop his horse riding lessons, even when his hands were crushed.

12:26.260 --> 12:27.840
I don't know the circumstances...

12:28.440 --> 12:30.610
But the talk from before was about going to Vienna, wasn't it?

12:31.840 --> 12:34.800
About whether you would go with Francis or Keith.

12:35.590 --> 12:36.880
To you, such a thing--

12:36.930 --> 12:37.960
You are confused, yes?

12:39.740 --> 12:42.660
If you are confused, then I will decide for you.

12:44.040 --> 12:44.900
Choose Keith.

12:46.730 --> 12:51.150
Keith gave up his social status as a noble, so he can be with you.

12:51.770 --> 12:53.200
But not Francis!

12:55.520 --> 12:57.300
I will never hand him over.

13:14.300 --> 13:17.270
I was told of Mary Ann's feelings to the extent that it hurts.

13:18.870 --> 13:20.400
Even so, I like Francis.

13:22.060 --> 13:23.810
But, these feelings...

13:24.160 --> 13:26.650
Are they stronger than Mary Ann's feelings?

13:35.220 --> 13:36.280
At that time...

13:36.700 --> 13:39.410
I danced the waltz with Francis for the first time.

13:41.680 --> 13:44.920
Keith retrieved my brooch.

13:51.210 --> 13:51.850
Keith...

13:54.790 --> 13:55.530
Francis...

14:00.450 --> 14:01.240
What should I do.

14:02.100 --> 14:03.510
I can't decide.

14:05.040 --> 14:05.750
Mother...

14:06.770 --> 14:09.800
Mother...did something like this happen to you too?

14:12.490 --> 14:14.760
What should I do?

14:15.460 --> 14:16.050
Nadja!

14:20.910 --> 14:23.110
I knew it! You're Nadja, aren't you?

14:28.980 --> 14:30.020
Julietta...

14:31.210 --> 14:33.900
What's wrong? You're getting wet.

14:38.490 --> 14:40.710
Are you here with your troupe?

14:41.160 --> 14:41.700
No.

14:42.240 --> 14:42.930
I see.

14:45.330 --> 14:47.970
Um...Julietta, why are you here?

14:48.510 --> 14:50.460
I was invited to tonight's party.

14:51.010 --> 14:54.190
My father has been acquainted with Earl Harcourt for a long time.

14:55.050 --> 14:56.190
I see.

14:57.050 --> 14:59.870
Nobles are quite close to each other, aren't they?

15:00.830 --> 15:01.250
Oh.

15:03.870 --> 15:05.840
I thought it would be warm today.

15:07.230 --> 15:07.840
Snow?

15:09.400 --> 15:09.970
Nadja.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.950
You're worrying about something, aren't you?

15:13.890 --> 15:15.740
You can talk to me about it if you'd like.

15:42.060 --> 15:42.780
I see.

15:44.280 --> 15:48.310
You are feeling pulled between the two men.

15:48.920 --> 15:49.440
Yes.

15:50.600 --> 15:52.630
Is it alright if I tell you my story?

15:54.060 --> 15:55.610
The story about my love.

15:56.030 --> 15:56.650
Love?

15:58.600 --> 15:59.810
You know about him, right?

16:00.430 --> 16:02.160
Antonio Fabiani.

16:02.550 --> 16:03.170
Huh?

16:04.430 --> 16:04.940
Yes...

16:06.900 --> 16:08.890
Back then, you...

16:11.070 --> 16:12.100
You saw it, didn't you?

16:12.920 --> 16:13.730
I'm sorry.

16:15.240 --> 16:15.860
It's alright.

16:17.120 --> 16:23.510
Back then, Antonio bought me a letter and a gift each day without fail.

16:23.810 --> 16:24.940
Each day?

16:25.560 --> 16:26.690
You mean everyday?

16:27.110 --> 16:27.710
Yes.

16:28.790 --> 16:34.870
When I think about it now, his goal was my social status as a countess.

16:35.660 --> 16:38.990
But he has only looked at me.

16:40.640 --> 16:41.280
That's right.

16:42.300 --> 16:44.590
Only at me, with passion.

16:45.880 --> 16:48.170
But you have a fiancé.

16:48.860 --> 16:52.690
Leonardo would never look at me.

16:54.020 --> 16:56.290
So, you've chosen Antonio?

16:57.970 --> 17:02.240
When I began dating Antonio, Leonardo changed.

17:02.960 --> 17:04.000
Leonardo did?

17:04.520 --> 17:08.070
He came to look at me as a woman.

17:09.380 --> 17:12.140
Leonardo wasn't the only one to change.

17:12.440 --> 17:14.120
Antonio changed as well?

17:16.440 --> 17:19.350
He began loving me in a reasonable way.

17:20.290 --> 17:21.920
Antonio did...?

17:22.560 --> 17:26.270
Right. I couldn't have those two waiting forever, could I?

17:27.130 --> 17:30.910
I felt that I needed to decide by myself.

17:31.940 --> 17:35.600
Leonardo or Antonio. Which should I choose?

17:40.860 --> 17:42.440
Whom did you choose?

17:46.530 --> 17:47.320
You see...

17:48.780 --> 17:51.220
I didn't choose the one who fell in love with me.

17:52.090 --> 17:54.460
I chose the one I fell in love with.

17:57.960 --> 17:59.640
The one I have fallen in love with...

18:21.220 --> 18:22.800
I also must decide by myself.

18:24.680 --> 18:25.440
Francis?

18:26.380 --> 18:26.950
Or Keith?

18:33.610 --> 18:36.530
At first, I yearned for the starry-eyed knight.

18:38.480 --> 18:40.350
The starry-eyed knight was Keith.

18:42.480 --> 18:45.640
Keith returned my brooch to me.

18:47.340 --> 18:50.920
I talked to Francis about many things in the mansion's garden.

18:52.180 --> 18:57.020
Whether you are an aristocrat or a commoner. Whatever your lineage, your wealth, or your education.

18:57.510 --> 19:00.920
Those don't determine a person's worth.

19:01.900 --> 19:07.630
What is important is how each person strives to live each day.

19:09.730 --> 19:11.040
Ah, a shooting star!

19:12.870 --> 19:15.190
With just love, I can't tell.

19:15.950 --> 19:17.680
When it comes down to it, I love...

19:19.900 --> 19:20.720
The White Rose?

19:21.140 --> 19:21.980
The Black Rose?

19:22.420 --> 19:23.140
Francis?

19:23.700 --> 19:24.350
Keith?

19:25.800 --> 19:26.860
The one I choose is...

21:36.670 --> 21:37.360
Francis.

21:38.840 --> 21:42.230
Ever since that time, I have been thinking of you.

22:14.180 --> 22:17.440
RONDON donyori haretara PARI

22:14.180 --> 22:17.440
Paris is sunnier than London

22:17.610 --> 22:20.630
KARUMEN menyori PAERIYA suki

22:17.610 --> 22:20.630
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:21.070 --> 22:27.270
SUPEEDO no jyoou kimagure yasan

22:21.070 --> 22:27.270
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:28.180 --> 22:29.440
kitto

22:28.180 --> 22:29.440
Indeed

22:32.200 --> 22:34.670
nayan datte muda yo

22:32.200 --> 22:34.670
It's no use worrying about it

22:34.720 --> 22:38.330
kesera sera sera sera

22:34.720 --> 22:38.330
Que sera sera, sera sera

22:38.570 --> 22:43.260
ashita nante itsumo naru youni

22:38.570 --> 22:43.260
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:43.360 --> 22:44.720
naru naru

22:43.360 --> 22:44.720
To be, to be

22:45.120 --> 22:50.050
sekai kaeru tobi KONKUURU

22:45.120 --> 22:50.050
The tree frog won.

22:50.550 --> 22:54.500
yuushou shita yo amagaeru

22:50.550 --> 22:54.500
The world frog jumping contest

22:57.680 --> 23:03.830
koneko chan no ashi no urawa

22:57.680 --> 23:03.830
Under the kitten's paw

23:04.300 --> 23:10.420
otentou sama no nioi da ne

23:04.300 --> 23:10.420
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:13.280 --> 23:16.640
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:13.280 --> 23:16.640
Paris is sunnier than London

23:16.690 --> 23:19.650
KARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:16.690 --> 23:19.650
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

23:20.200 --> 23:26.620
michikusa shite iru baaijyanai ne

23:20.200 --> 23:26.620
It's not the time to hang around

23:27.460 --> 23:31.970
kitto kitto

23:27.460 --> 23:31.970
Indeed, indeed

23:40.110 --> 23:41.860
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:41.970 --> 23:43.870
Francis and Mary Ann are engaged?

23:44.580 --> 23:47.920
But, Francis said he loves me.

23:48.630 --> 23:51.220
That we should go to the Preminger Dukedom together.

23:51.940 --> 23:56.850
Despite that, Mary Ann came and said that she would never give Francis up.

23:57.670 --> 24:00.510
Even if you say so, my feelings won't change!

24:01.470 --> 24:02.260
Tomorrow's Nadja.

24:02.820 --> 24:05.180
Three Person Triangle. The Reeling, Loving Heart

24:05.270 --> 24:06.930
Now, the door to destiny opens.
